# CONTRIBUTING Contribute-Guide SoT

[`CONTRIBUTING.md`](../../CONTRIBUTING.md) is the **human contribute-guide SoT**: prerequisites, setup, quality gate + DX, contribute workflow, commits/PRs, Issues/SECURITY, documentation map of links.

It is **not** a Design SoT, directory layout map, coverage SoT, exit-code SoT, adapter catalog, or fragile-risk catalog.

**Ownership:** [DOC-OWNERSHIP.md](../../.specs/codebase/DOC-OWNERSHIP.md).

## Forbidden in CONTRIBUTING.md

- Milestone tags: `\bM\d+\b`
- Directory trees — link STRUCTURE
- Coverage threshold tables — link TESTING
- Local exit-code tables or `!= 0` shorthand — link `docs/cli-reference.md` § Exit codes
- `## Architecture boundaries` / `## Fragile areas` dumps — link INTEGRATIONS / CONCERNS

## Allowed

- `HOTSPOT-*` as naming convention when describing feature specs
- Gate `pnpm build && pnpm test`, recommended `typecheck` / `lint` / `format:check`
- Documentation map of links only

## Sync rule

1. Update only when gate, DX scripts, prerequisites, or contribute/PR workflow changed.
2. Do not mirror STRUCTURE, TESTING, INTEGRATIONS, CONCERNS, or the exit-code table — link those SoTs.

Editorial lint: [living-sot-doc.mjs](../hooks/lib/living-sot-doc.mjs) `lintContributingDoc`.
